From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Conor McCarthy <cmccarthy@codeweavers.com>
Date: Wed, 6 Aug 2025 23:18:26 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] winedmo: HACK: Do not check for opus decoder support.

Opus is not supported in the ffmpeg build distributed with this, but it
is supported in GStreamer.

CW-Bug-Id: #25767
(cherry picked from commit 2389039f129efbd14d3df5111a043c7df4c101bd)
---
 dlls/winedmo/unix_demuxer_mediaconv.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dlls/winedmo/unix_demuxer_mediaconv.c b/dlls/winedmo/unix_demuxer_mediaconv.c
index fd89d0e5e56..063f8db2043 100644
--- a/dlls/winedmo/unix_demuxer_mediaconv.c
+++ b/dlls/winedmo/unix_demuxer_mediaconv.c
@@ -202,7 +202,7 @@ int mediaconv_demuxer_open( AVFormatContext **ctx, struct stream_context *contex
             if (par->codec_id && !strcmp("h264", avcodec_get_name(par->codec_id)))
                     create_placeholder_file("h264-used");
             if (!par->codec_id) FIXME( "Ignoring unknown codec on stream %u\n", i );
-            else if (!avcodec_find_decoder( par->codec_id )) break;
+            else if (par->codec_id != AV_CODEC_ID_OPUS && !avcodec_find_decoder( par->codec_id )) break;
         }
         if (i == (*ctx)->nb_streams) return 0;
 
